🐍 Python vs 🟨 JavaScript

Ye room Python wale room se compare karne ke liye bhi hai.
Kaam	Python	JavaScript
Variable	tries = 0	let tries = 0;
Constant	—	const secret = ...
Output	print()	console.log()
Input	input()	rl.question()
Text → number	int()	parseInt()
OR	or	`
Not equal	!=	!==
Condition	if	if
Else-if	elif	else if
Loop	while	while

Python:

elif guess < secret:

JavaScript:

else if (guess < secret) {

Python mein indentation important hai, JavaScript mein { } braces use hote hain.
